#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:3
msgid "AMDGPU Asynchronous Operations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:6
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "簡介"

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:8
msgid ""
"Asynchronous operations are operations whose completion is not tracked "
"internally by the compiler. A thread that initiates one or more async "
"operations can use *asyncmarks* to track their completion."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:12
msgid "Most {ref}`DMA operations <amdgpu-dma-operations>` are asynchronous."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:14
msgid "Asyncmarks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:16
msgid ""
"An *asyncmark* created by a thread can be used to track async operations "
"initiated by that thread."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:19
msgid "Current Sequence"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:21
msgid ""
"The abstract machine maintains a sequence of asyncmarks during the execution "
"of a function body, which excludes any asyncmarks produced by calls to other "
"functions encountered in the currently executing function. The state of this "
"sequence at each program point in the function is called the *current "
"sequence*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:26
msgid "`@llvm.amdgcn.asyncmark()`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:28
msgid "Produces an asyncmark and appends it to the current sequence."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:30
msgid "`@llvm.amdgcn.wait.asyncmark(i16 %N)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:32
msgid ""
"Ensures that the length of the current sequence is at most `N` by removing "
"asyncmarks from the start of the sequence if it is more than `N`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:35
msgid "Completion of Asyncmarks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:37
msgid ""
"An `asyncmark()` operation `X` that produces an asyncmark `M` is *completed-"
"at* a `wait.asyncmark()` operation `Y` in the same function body if:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:41
msgid "`X` is *program-ordered* before `Y`, and"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:42
msgid ""
"`M` is not in the current sequence at any operation `Z` that immediately "
"follows `Y` in *program-order*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:45
msgid "Completion of Async Operations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:47
msgid ""
"An async operation executes outside the thread that initiated it, i.e., it "
"is not related in *program-order* with any other operations from that "
"thread. But the thread can use an asyncmark to ensure that the async "
"operation is *completed-at* some later operation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:52
msgid ""
"An async operation `A` *initiated-by* an instruction `I` is *completed-at* "
"some `wait.asyncmark()` operation `Y` if there exists an `asyncmark()` "
"operation `X` such that:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:55
msgid "`I` is *program-ordered* before `X`, and"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:56
msgid "`X` is *completed-at* `Y`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:58
msgid "happens-before"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:60
msgid ""
"When an instruction `I` initiates an async operation `A`, `I` *happens-"
"before* `A`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.md:63
msgid ""
"If `A` is *completed-at* a `wait.asyncmark()` operation `Y`, then `A` "
"*happens-before* `Y`."
msgstr ""

